{"reference":"2 Chronicles 1","book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":1,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"historical_context","title":"Solomon's Reign in the Larger Story","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Solomon's request for wisdom is presented as part of a larger account in which his wisdom and temple building complete David's preparations. The following chapters carry that account forward through the ark, the temple's dedication, celebration, God's response, and warning.","verse_refs":["2 Chronicles 1:7-13"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_2_chronicles_001_3e1dde8df29b03969a88ba54"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"fact"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}